{"pageProps":{"lesson":{"day":8,"title":"Day 8: Describing a problem — SpeakSprint","heading":"Describing a problem","kicker":"DAY 08 · 30 MINUTES · 6 SESSIONS / WEEK","description":"Mô tả vấn đề một cách rõ ràng.","contentVersion":2,"answers":{"comp":"b|a|b","quiz":"b|a"},"sections":[{"id":"mission","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">MISSION · 1 MIN</span><h2>Today's mission</h2><p>Describe a recent problem: what, when, and who it affects. Speak for <b>120 seconds</b>, using at least <b>3 of today’s 5 chunks</b>. Say it first; write only brief notes.</p><p class=\"instruction\">5 chunk mỗi ngày · tối đa 5 chunk mới. Ngày tổng kết ôn lại chunk đã học.</p>"},{"id":"weekly-baseline","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">BEFORE PRACTICE · 1 MIN</span><p class=\"instruction\">Làm bài nói đầu tuần trước khi đọc bài và xem ví dụ. Ghi lại những gì bạn tự nói được.</p><div class=\"weekly-check\"><h3>Weekly baseline</h3><p>Repeat this same 60-second task at the beginning and end of the week: <b>Describe a work problem, its impact, and one action to try.</b></p><p class=\"instruction\">Làm riêng với bài nói chính nếu thời lượng khác. Tự đếm số lần dừng lâu hơn 3 giây; không suy ra độ chính xác từ thời lượng.</p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\">Actual baseline speaking seconds:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\">Pauses longer than 3 seconds:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\">Target chunks used (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\">Chunks recalled without help (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\">A recurring error to work on:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\"><p id=\"weekly-comparison\" role=\"status\"></p></div>"},{"id":"warmup","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Warm-up recall</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Recall before opening today’s chunk cards. Ôn theo mốc bài học +1, +3, +7, +14; mỗi lần chọn vài chunk để giữ bài gọn.</p><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 7 · ôn sau 1 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Describe how you begin your workday. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I usually start by reviewing my task list.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 5 · ôn sau 3 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>State your plan for today. <small>Use it in a different project or situation.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Today, I'm going to connect the page to the server.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 1 · ôn sau 7 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Introduce your job to a new colleague. <small>Say two connected sentences aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I work as a developer on a small product team.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"reading","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">We're having an issue with the checkout button. It doesn't work when customers use a phone. We first noticed it this morning during testing. It affects mobile users, but the computer version is working. The expected result is for the payment page to open. Instead, the page stays the same. Right now, I'm checking the test results. I share them with our developers so they can see what happens. Could you help me with one more test? We need to understand the problem before we decide what to change.</div>"},{"id":"comprehension","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"comp","label":"COMPREHENSION · 3 MIN","heading":"Check the message","hint":"Look for who, what happened, and why the speaker says it.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. What is the speaker reporting?","choices":[{"text":" A successful payment","name":"comp-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp1"},{"text":" A checkout problem","name":"comp-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp1"}]},{"prompt":"2. Who is affected?","choices":[{"text":" Mobile users","name":"comp-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp2"},{"text":" All computer users","name":"comp-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp2"}]},{"prompt":"3. Why does the speaker want another test?","choices":[{"text":" To announce that it is fixed","name":"comp-3","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp3"},{"text":" To understand the problem better","name":"comp-3","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp3"}]}]},{"id":"chunks","className":"panel","type":"chunks","label":"CHUNKS · 5 MIN","heading":"Five chunks to use today","instruction":"Learn the whole phrase. Change the details to fit your work. Mở từng thẻ khi cần; sau đó nhìn đi chỗ khác và nói lại.","items":[{"label":"1/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"We're having an issue with…","meaning":"Chúng tôi đang gặp vấn đề với…","details":["Introduce a problem that needs attention.","We're having an issue with + noun","We're having an issue with the app.","We're having an issue with the checkout button."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-1"},{"label":"2/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"It doesn't work when…","meaning":"Nó không hoạt động khi…","details":["Describe the condition that triggers a problem.","It doesn't work when + clause","It doesn't work when I click here.","It doesn't work when customers use a phone."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-2"},{"label":"3/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"We first noticed it…","meaning":"Lần đầu chúng tôi nhận thấy lỗi là…","details":["Say when a problem was first observed.","We first noticed it + time","We first noticed it today.","We first noticed it this morning during testing."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-3"},{"label":"4/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"It affects…","meaning":"Nó ảnh hưởng đến…","details":["Identify who or what is affected.","It affects + people / thing","It affects mobile users.","It affects customers who use the payment page."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-4"},{"label":"5/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"The expected result is…","meaning":"Kết quả mong đợi là…","details":["Describe what should happen when the feature works.","The expected result is + noun / for someone to + verb","The expected result is a confirmation message.","The expected result is for the payment page to open."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-5"}]},{"id":"variation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">VARIATION · 4 MIN</span><h2>Change it, then make it yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Say each answer first, then type a short sentence. Two quick variations per chunk; keep the same pattern.</p><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>1. We're having an issue with…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\">A. Use this idea: the payment page.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>2. It doesn't work when…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\">A. Use this idea: the internet connection is slow.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>3. We first noticed it…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\">A. Use this idea: on Monday.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>4. It affects…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\">A. Use this idea: the support team.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>5. The expected result is…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\">A. Use this idea: a new order in the list.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\"></div>"},{"id":"rapid-recall","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RAPID RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Recall in about three seconds</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Look away from the chunk cards. Try to start speaking within 3 seconds, then type what you said. A model appears only after an attempt; other natural answers are possible.</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Introduce a problem that needs attention. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We're having an issue with the checkout button.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Describe the condition that triggers a problem. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"It doesn't work when customers use a phone.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Say when a problem was first observed. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We first noticed it this morning during testing.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Identify who or what is affected. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"It affects customers who use the payment page.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Describe what should happen when the feature works. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"The expected result is for the payment page to open.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Introduce your job to a new colleague. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I work as a developer on a small product team.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"speaking","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">SPEAK · 5 MIN</span><h2>Make the language yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read aloud three times. Follow the pauses marked by / and emphasize the important words.</p><div class=\"shadow\">We're having an issue with the app. /<br>It doesn't work when I click here. /<br>We first noticed it today.</div><p><b>Speaking challenge:</b> Describe a recent problem: what, when, and who it affects.</p><p class=\"instruction\">Speak for 120 seconds. Use at least 3 chunks. Notes only: your situation · two details · a reason or problem · your next step. Do not write a full script first.</p><textarea id=\"speaking-response\" data-save=\"speaking\" placeholder=\"Nói thành tiếng trước, rồi nhập lại ít nhất 8 từ bạn đã nói…\"></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"speaking-done\">Tôi đã nói thành tiếng</button><span id=\"status-speaking\">Chưa hoàn thành</span></div><div id=\"speak-feedback\" class=\"feedback\"></div>"},{"id":"conversation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What problem are you seeing?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>Who is affected?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>What have you checked so far?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What do you suggest we do next?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"},{"id":"quiz","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"quiz","label":"END CHECK · 2 MIN","heading":"Choose a useful chunk","hint":"Think about the situation where you would use the phrase.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. Introduce a problem that needs attention.","choices":[{"text":" It affects…","name":"quiz-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"},{"text":" We're having an issue with…","name":"quiz-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"}]},{"prompt":"2. Describe what should happen when the feature works.","choices":[{"text":" The expected result is…","name":"quiz-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"},{"text":" It doesn't work when…","name":"quiz-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"}]}]},{"id":"daily-progress","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">REVIEW · 2 MIN</span><h2>Today's progress</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Các số về nói và nhớ chunk là tự đánh giá; số câu đọc hiểu lấy từ lần nộp gần nhất. Chưa nhập nghĩa là chưa có dữ liệu.</p><p id=\"chunk-progress\" role=\"status\"></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-seconds\">Actual speaking time (seconds):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-improvement\">One thing I can do better now:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-improvement\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-improvement\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-next\">Tomorrow, one small thing I will practise:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-next\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-next\">"}],"completionText":"Hoàn thành đọc hiểu, kể lần một, quiz và các bước Recall → Think → đối chiếu → kể lần hai. Nhiều bài trong cùng ngày chỉ tính một ngày streak.","navigation":[{"href":"../index.html","text":"← Dashboard"},{"href":"day-09.html","text":"Day 9 →"}]},"pageType":"lesson"},"__N_SSG":true}